      <h1>About The Queen Dairy Menu</h1>
    <p><strong>The Queen Dairy Menu (thequeendairymenu.us) operates as an independent, community-focused culinary and price guide.</strong> Our primary mission is clear-cut: to deliver the most precise, easily navigable, and comprehensive overview of the Dairy Queen® menu available on the web. We want you to know exactly what's available, how much it costs, and what to expect before you ever approach the counter or drive-thru window. Please note that we are entirely independent—we have no affiliation with, endorsement from, or sponsorship by Dairy Queen®, International Dairy Queen, Inc., or Berkshire Hathaway Inc.</p>
