    <h2>Who We Are</h2>
    <p>Behind this site is a passionate, small team of dedicated Dairy Queen enthusiasts—not corporate staff. We are real customers who frequently dine at DQ, eagerly anticipate seasonal Blizzard changes, and simply grew frustrated trying to piece together accurate prices and nutrition facts from fragmented, outdated websites. That frustration led us to build this centralized resource, and we've meticulously maintained it ever since. We maintain complete editorial independence, meaning the company exerts zero influence or control over our content.</p>

    <h2>Why We Built This Site</h2>
    <p>The Dairy Queen menu is remarkably fluid. Between seasonal Blizzard drops, the constant ebb and flow of limited-time offerings, and pricing that varies from franchise to franchise, it can be hard to keep up. Before this site, there wasn't a single, well-structured hub where fans could view the entire menu alongside realistic pricing and transparent calorie counts. We built this platform to bridge that gap, offering a highly searchable, honest, and constantly updated resource.</p>

    <h2>How We Research and Verify Our Information</h2>
    <p>Providing accurate menu details is our top priority, and we approach it with rigor. Our verification methodology draws from several key avenues:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Official public data</strong> — We use official Dairy Queen menu releases, alongside their nutrition and allergen guides, as our foundational baseline.</li>
      <li><strong>Local and regional menu boards</strong> — Since individual franchises determine their own pricing, we analyze menu boards and customer receipts from various locations to establish realistic average costs.</li>
      <li><strong>Continuous monitoring</strong> — We closely follow announcements for seasonal rollouts and limited-time specials, tracking them as they hit local stores.</li>
      <li><strong>Transparent estimations</strong> — Whenever a price is an average or heavily dependent on location, we clearly state it, avoiding the misconception of a flat national price.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>In cases where data conflicts or menu items undergo sudden changes, we purposefully default to the most conservative, verifiable numbers and clearly flag any approximations.</p>

    <h2>How Often We Update</h2>
    <p>Our team continually audits and updates the site's content year-round. We pay special attention to the revolving door of seasonal Blizzards, fresh limited-time offerings, and necessary price adjustments. Individual item pages are tweaked as menus evolve, and we are committed to fixing any reported errors immediately.</p>

    <h2>What We Cover</h2>
    <p>We detail the entire DQ lineup: iconic Blizzard Treats (including seasonal variants), savory Signature Stackburgers, Chicken Strip Baskets, nostalgic Classic Treats, Breakfast choices (where available), Drinks, custom DQ Cakes, Snacks &amp; Sides, Kids Meals, and the most recent <a href="/combos">deals and combos</a>. You can explore everything via <a href="/#full-menu">the full menu</a> or drill down by specific categories.</p>

    <h2>A Note on Prices and Accuracy</h2>
    <p>Please treat every price and calorie figure on this site as a <strong>2026 estimate, not an official quote</strong>. Dairy Queen locations are independently owned and operated, and they set their own prices — so your local store may differ from the averages we list. Menu availability (especially breakfast and limited-time items) also varies by location. For an exact price or to confirm an item is available, contact your <a href="/locations">local DQ</a>. Nutrition figures are provided for general reference; if you have an allergy or dietary need, rely on the official Dairy Queen allergen information.</p>

    <h2>Editorial Independence &amp; How This Site Is Funded</h2>
    <p>This site is free to use and is supported by advertising, including <strong>Google AdSense</strong>. Advertising revenue keeps the site running, but it does not influence our content: we do not accept payment from Dairy Queen or any brand to alter prices, calories, or descriptions, and ads are clearly identifiable as ads. You can read more in our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> and <a href="/disclaimer">Disclaimer</a>.</p>

    <h2>Corrections &amp; Feedback</h2>
    <p>Spotted an out-of-date price or an error? We genuinely want to know — reader corrections are one of the best ways we keep this site accurate. Please <a href="/contact">send us the details</a> (item, location, and what you saw), and we will review and update it.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions, corrections, or suggestions are always welcome through our <a href="/contact">contact form</a>. You can also follow along on the social channels linked in the footer.</p>

    <h2>Disclaimer</h2>
    <p>This site is not affiliated with Dairy Queen® or International Dairy Queen, Inc. All Dairy Queen® trademarks — including Blizzard®, Peanut Buster®, Dilly Bar®, FlameThrower®, MooLatté®, and DQ® — are the property of their respective owners and are used here for nominative reference only. See our full <a href="/disclaimer">disclaimer</a> for details.
